WEBVTT

00:01:52.430 --> 00:01:56.920
Last time on Dragon Ball Z, using a strange sneak attack,

00:01:57.020 --> 00:02:00.000
Majin Buu ensnared both Piccolo and the freshly fused

00:02:00.410 --> 00:02:13.070
Gotenks and absorbed them into his body.

00:02:13.070 --> 00:02:17.750
Knowing he could not match Gohan's newly acquired powers in his present state, Majin

00:02:17.750 --> 00:02:20.530
Buu opted for a transformation.

00:02:20.530 --> 00:02:26.390
Incorporating the powers of Gotenks at Super Saiyan 3 and the combat wisdom of Piccolo,

00:02:26.390 --> 00:02:30.000
a new Super Buu was created.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:35.200
it merged Gohan's childhood teacher, as well as his little brother. It was Abu who knew

00:02:35.200 --> 00:02:37.460
Gohan all too well.

00:02:37.460 --> 00:02:47.900
What do you think of it? New clothes, and a few new abilities.

00:02:47.900 --> 00:02:52.140
If you're using Piccolo's brains, you know you've got 30 minutes until this newfound

00:02:52.140 --> 00:02:54.910
strength of yours defuses.

00:02:54.910 --> 00:03:00.000
I assure you it will be over before then, and I definitely

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:03.230
I didn't absorb you because I needed a punching bag.

00:03:03.230 --> 00:03:06.370
I kept you around because I'm stronger than ever.

00:03:06.370 --> 00:03:08.950
And I have to try it on someone.

00:03:08.950 --> 00:03:09.950
Sounds fine.

00:03:09.950 --> 00:03:10.950
I'm all yours.

00:03:10.950 --> 00:03:14.220
Let's do this.

00:03:14.220 --> 00:03:18.140
And so the battle with the newest incarnation of Buu began.

00:03:18.140 --> 00:03:23.180
And where Gohan had previously been in total control of the action, he was now struggling

00:03:23.180 --> 00:03:26.310
with all of his might just to stay alive.

00:03:31.850 --> 00:03:39.350
remember not so long ago i was the one hiding i needed time to stall is that what you're doing

00:03:39.350 --> 00:03:47.920
now gohan your beloved piccolo is a part of me and i can sense that you're alive down there kid

00:03:47.920 --> 00:03:55.890
will gohan have to fight this battle for earth totally alone find out now on dragon ball z

00:04:27.100 --> 00:04:29.030
than that.

00:04:32.170 --> 00:04:34.790
You're not paying attention to my moves.

00:04:34.790 --> 00:04:38.660
Piccolo taught you better than this, didn't he?

00:04:38.660 --> 00:04:40.750
Yes, he did!

00:04:45.490 --> 00:04:50.830
Spin your head.

00:04:54.950 --> 00:04:57.510
And with all that training on the cliff...

00:05:12.220 --> 00:05:15.580
-Can't see what's happening. -Oh, Gohan's in top form,

00:05:15.660 --> 00:05:17.380
but it's simply not going to be enough.

00:05:19.090 --> 00:05:19.930
Gohan!

00:05:27.940 --> 00:05:28.580
Hmm?

00:06:38.600 --> 00:06:42.560
Now that felt like a piccolo technique.

00:06:45.180 --> 00:06:49.380
I really didn't think the special beam can impact that much of a punch,

00:06:50.490 --> 00:06:56.440
but maybe it's just that much stronger now that it's coming through me.

00:06:56.650 --> 00:06:58.230
What do you think of that?

00:07:03.130 --> 00:07:04.570
"Are you even awake?"

00:07:04.570 --> 00:07:13.310
"Letting them down again."

00:07:15.140 --> 00:07:30.000
"This has the greatest powers in the universe!"

00:07:32.780 --> 00:07:36.560
And I'll use them all to kill you!

00:08:09.150 --> 00:08:18.410
Did you see that?

00:08:18.410 --> 00:08:21.150
Mazin Boo just burped up some kind of mini-boo.

00:08:21.150 --> 00:08:23.150
What is that?

00:08:23.150 --> 00:08:25.110
How do you expect me to know?

00:08:32.520 --> 00:08:34.480
Woah! What the heck is that thing?

00:08:48.970 --> 00:08:49.770
Touch him!

00:08:51.370 --> 00:08:53.080
AHHHHH!

00:09:26.080 --> 00:09:27.820
You can thank Gotenks for that

00:09:27.820 --> 00:09:30.000
technique. I know my little

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:34.880
super ghost could have spun a dozen different moves at you, but you just keep making it so

00:09:34.880 --> 00:09:47.490
easy, Gohan. It's kind of sad. I almost feel guilty. Ah, there must be something you're

00:09:47.490 --> 00:09:55.760
still anxious to prove, Gohan. How amusing. Oh, please don't let me be dead. There's so

00:09:55.760 --> 00:09:57.200
many things I never did.

00:10:00.350 --> 00:10:01.350
Am I alive?

00:10:01.730 --> 00:10:04.030
I'm alive! We've been saved!

00:10:05.980 --> 00:10:07.980
Where'd the puppy go?

00:10:14.210 --> 00:10:16.710
The whole world is depending on you.

00:10:17.160 --> 00:10:18.530
You're the savior.

00:10:18.950 --> 00:10:21.280
And you're three breaths away from the end.

00:10:28.390 --> 00:10:29.600
Where is he?

00:10:43.720 --> 00:10:45.800
We can't keep this up any longer.

00:10:45.800 --> 00:10:49.250
There's got to be something we can do!

00:10:49.250 --> 00:10:52.300
That's an interesting point you make, Goku.

00:10:52.300 --> 00:10:56.710
Perhaps we can help Gohan by sending you down to fight.

00:10:56.710 --> 00:11:00.000
Huh? But... I can't...

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:06.080
go. Yes, that's correct. In his present state, he's unable to return to Earth ever again.

00:11:06.080 --> 00:11:14.710
You think I don't know that? I'll give you the life that's left inside of me. Then you can make

00:11:14.710 --> 00:11:21.800
your return to Earth. You mean you're giving up your life for me? Venerable Elder, this is the most

00:11:21.800 --> 00:11:30.000
unorthodox behavior. You can't just offer up your life to handle a single situation. As usual, you're missing the

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:34.000
bigger picture. After Earth, Majin Buu will come here.

00:11:34.000 --> 00:11:38.660
If that is true, then let me give up my life.

00:11:38.660 --> 00:11:40.690
What? No, master.

00:11:40.690 --> 00:11:45.490
Majin Buu has been my enemy to destroy since Biviti thousands of years ago, and repeatedly

00:11:45.490 --> 00:11:52.570
I have failed. You must allow me to pay my own debt.

00:11:52.570 --> 00:11:59.060
You're ambitious, but too hard on yourself. Let the old men sacrifice their lives so that

00:11:59.060 --> 00:12:00.000
the young ones can

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:15.620
live my dear Kai you're too kind what is going on here is this some kind of a

00:12:15.620 --> 00:12:21.610
joke no far from it we're going to send the best fighter we have here to help

00:12:21.610 --> 00:12:28.710
them fight boo I want you to escort him there Baba I will take care of the rest

00:12:30.090 --> 00:12:35.410
For the record, you should know that this is a bad idea, but if you think it will save the universe...

00:12:35.410 --> 00:12:40.340
The mighty King Yama comes groveling to me!

00:12:40.340 --> 00:12:46.480
Well, the deal stays, regardless of the outcome, and I don't plan to blow myself up for him again.

00:12:46.480 --> 00:12:54.870
You're what we have. You two must leave immediately if you're to make a difference. Now go!

00:12:54.870 --> 00:12:59.210
Very well, sir. But does it have to be me?

00:12:59.210 --> 00:13:00.000
Baba?

00:13:00.250 --> 00:13:02.180
I won't take no for an answer.

00:13:02.180 --> 00:13:08.790
I'm just saying Margin Boo is really big and strong, and look at me, I'm just a wiry old woman floating on a ball.

00:13:08.790 --> 00:13:11.050
Enough!

00:13:11.050 --> 00:13:13.520
Back to Earth then.

00:13:13.520 --> 00:13:17.580
So be it.

00:13:17.580 --> 00:13:18.750
Kakarot.

00:13:18.750 --> 00:13:24.790
Pity you won't be there to greet me.

00:14:07.930 --> 00:14:24.310
Good night, Goron. Without your father holding your hand, you really are nothing.

00:15:01.180 --> 00:15:08.390
*Grunting*

00:15:32.490 --> 00:16:00.000
Another Gotenks move out of the hat, hope it's not too tight. How does it feel to be

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:15.570
bound by your baby brother's moves gohan no stop me if you've heard this one

00:16:15.570 --> 00:16:29.000
before one final move and game over

00:16:30.760 --> 00:16:31.820
Kamehame!

00:17:10.780 --> 00:17:13.060
What are we supposed to do?

00:17:30.410 --> 00:17:30.910
*Gasp*

00:17:40.180 --> 00:17:49.650
*Gasp*

00:18:00.410 --> 00:18:01.800
Thank you.

00:18:01.800 --> 00:18:06.330
I promise, I won't let this go to waste.

00:18:06.330 --> 00:18:08.310
Then hurry up!

00:18:08.310 --> 00:18:09.340
GAH!

00:18:09.340 --> 00:18:11.230
What are you doing?

00:18:11.230 --> 00:18:15.010
You're standing there looking like fools when you should be saving the universe!

00:18:15.010 --> 00:18:17.510
*laughs*

00:18:47.370 --> 00:18:50.320
Fighting only proves your cowardice, my young fighter.

00:19:00.960 --> 00:19:04.610
That really hurt, didn't it, Gohan?

00:19:04.610 --> 00:19:07.910
Facing your fears would've been far less painful.

00:19:07.910 --> 00:19:12.840
Still wanting to fight?

00:19:12.840 --> 00:19:14.580
Take your best shot.

00:19:14.580 --> 00:19:16.290
You can't hit me.

00:19:16.290 --> 00:19:25.320
*Groan*

00:20:00.380 --> 00:20:01.240
Still alive.

00:20:01.770 --> 00:20:04.790
Well, I guess I'll have to make sports out of smacking you around.

00:20:07.080 --> 00:20:18.270
That's bad.

00:20:18.640 --> 00:20:20.650
That sounds like something really bad.

00:20:22.590 --> 00:20:26.650
You should grab the puppy and get as far away from here as you can right now.

00:20:27.970 --> 00:20:29.680
Don't you worry about me.

00:20:30.320 --> 00:20:34.530
I'm a master of martial arts, and I'm also packing some serious heat.

00:20:34.530 --> 00:20:37.230
And as soon as Majin Buu pops his head out of that hole,

00:20:37.230 --> 00:20:45.210
he's gonna be eating lead salad!

00:20:45.210 --> 00:20:48.120
Okay, I've got to go.

00:20:48.120 --> 00:20:50.380
Hold on one second, Goku.

00:20:50.380 --> 00:20:51.370
Huh?

00:20:51.370 --> 00:20:56.710
What you're doing is noble, but do you even have a strategy for defeating Majin Buu yet?

00:20:56.710 --> 00:21:00.000
I hate to rain on your new life parade, but Majin Buu...

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:03.010
can still beat you and Gohan without much effort.

00:21:03.010 --> 00:21:05.190
Uh, all right.

00:21:05.190 --> 00:21:07.170
Hmm.

00:21:07.170 --> 00:21:08.670
Okay, I got it.

00:21:08.670 --> 00:21:10.570
I'll just do a fusion with Gohan,

00:21:10.570 --> 00:21:13.730
and that way we're bound to win, right?

00:21:13.730 --> 00:21:15.270
Ah, fusion.

00:21:15.270 --> 00:21:18.740
You mean of the type those kids have been using?

00:21:18.740 --> 00:21:21.850
You think Majin Buu is just gonna sit on his laurels

00:21:21.850 --> 00:21:23.410
and wait for you two to practice

00:21:23.410 --> 00:21:25.150
and get into just the right stance?

00:21:25.150 --> 00:21:26.530
I don't think so.

00:21:26.530 --> 00:21:29.090
I'm afraid I don't understand, old Kai.

00:21:29.090 --> 00:21:30.000
Why did you get...

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:40.690
up your life if you didn't think there was a way i could beat him try these on go ahead snap this

00:21:40.690 --> 00:21:48.280
onto your left ear would you but what will dressing him like a kai accomplish strange

00:21:48.280 --> 00:21:55.430
quiet you two it's time you learned is this supposed to make me feel strong or something

00:21:55.430 --> 00:22:00.000
because i don't feel much different now simply have gohan snap

00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:02.440
this one under his right ear.

00:22:02.440 --> 00:22:04.640
Immediately, your bodies will be bound together

00:22:04.640 --> 00:22:05.820
and much stronger.

00:22:05.820 --> 00:22:08.040
My type of fusion.

00:22:08.040 --> 00:22:12.350
- No kidding?

00:22:12.350 --> 00:22:14.930
- As Gohan bravely tries to hold his own

00:22:14.930 --> 00:22:17.910
on planet Earth, Goku has taken a new life

00:22:17.910 --> 00:22:20.880
and readied himself to come to his son's aid.

00:22:20.880 --> 00:22:23.680
Will the secret of the Elder Kai's fusion earrings

00:22:23.680 --> 00:22:26.910
be enough to finish Majin Buu once and for all?

00:22:26.910 --> 00:22:30.000
Stay tuned for more excitement on Dragon Ball.
